  "renderedHtml": "</div> \n    </div>\n<div id='main' class='all_colors' data-scroll-offset=\"0\">\n<div id=\"av_section_1\" class=\" only-desktop avia-section main_color avia-section-no-padding avia-no-border-styling avia-full-stretch avia-bg-style-scroll  avia-builder-el-0  el_before_av_submenu  avia-builder-el-first   av-minimum-height av-minimum-height-custom container_wrap fullsize\" style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; background-image: url(\nhttps://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/stone-image.jpg); background-attachment: scroll; background-position: center center; \" data-section-bg-repeat=\"stretch\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"height:450px\"><main role=\"main\" itemprop=\"mainContentOfPage\" class=\"template-page content  av-content-full alpha units\"><div class=\"post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-22\"><div class=\"entry-content-wrapper clearfix\">\n</div></div></main></div></div>\n    <div id=\"av_section_mobile\" class=\" only-mobile\"  style=\"max-height:450px; max-width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/stone-image.jpg\"></div>\n<div class='clear'></div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n<section class=\"row\" id=\"introductionwelcome\" class=\"introductionwelcome\">\n\t<div  id=\"divintroductionThird\" class=\"divsectiontext\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;\">\n\t\t <br class=\"separatorintro\" />\n\t\t\t  <h1 style=\"margin-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0;\">Brick and Stone Cleaning </h1>\n\t\t\t<h2>by Complete Restoration </h2>\n       </div> \n       <hr class=\"hrseparatortop\" style=\"margin-top:40px !important;\">\n    <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n    <br class=\"tabseparatortop\" />\n </section>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n<section class=\"row target-section\" id=\"row_columns\" ><a name=\"featured\" class=\"anchor_position\"></a>\n  <div class=\"home-intro-texto\" id=\"landlords-column\">\n    <div class=\"divsectioncontent\"  >\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n                <h4 class='h4_inner'>It always seems a shame to see natural brick and stone covered in paint, when just beneath the surface is a far more natural finish that will be more in keeping with the traditional building, and will always increase the value of your property.\r\n</h4>\n              <p>The Complete Restoration Company removes the paint from brick and stone using a number of specialist techniques. If we detect that the bricks are hard, we remove the paint by carefully shot blasting the brick back to the natural surface. If we identify that the bricks are soft, we use a specialist chemical process as shot blasting will damage the brick or stone beyond repair.</p>\n<p>We then neutralise the chemicals on the surface of the wall, re-point any mortar that has disintegrated over the years, ready for you to enjoy it in all its natural splendour. We can also refurbish walls that have been polluted by acid rain or have a layer of carbon build up on them</p>\n             </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n  </div>\n     <div class=\"\"  id=\"tenants-column\">\n<div class=\"\"  style=\"background:#6e6e6d url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/form_bricks.svg);no-repeat;cover;\">\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n              <h2 id=\"form-title\">Get a quote today</h2>\n             <p id=\"form-subtitle\"></p>\n               <div role=\"form\" class=\"wpcf7\" id=\"wpcf7-f521-p1915-o1\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"></div>\n<form action=\"/services/brick-and-stone-cleaning/#wpcf7-f521-p1915-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form form-contact\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" id=\"form-contact\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"521\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"5.1.3\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f521-p1915-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"1915\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"g-recaptcha-response\" value=\"\" />\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-name\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"your-name\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Name:\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-email\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"your-email\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-validates-as-email enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Email:\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-tel\"><input type=\"tel\" name=\"your-tel\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-tel wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-validates-as-tel enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Tel:\" /></span></p>\n<div class=\"submit\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;\"><span id=\"confirm-btn\" class=\"\"><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Contact us\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit\" id=\"enquiry-send\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"divconsense\">\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap checkbox-923\"><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-checkbox wpcf7-validates-as-required\"><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item first last\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"checkbox-923[]\" value=\"By clicking confirm, you agree that we may process your information in accordance with these terms. Complete Restoration Ltd will use the information you provide on this form to be in touch with you and to provide updates and marketing via email. You can change your mind at any time by contacting us at &#039;info@completerestoration.co.uk&#039;. We will treat your information with respect. For more information about our privacy practices please visit the privacy policy page.\" /><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item-label\">By clicking confirm, you agree that we may process your information in accordance with these terms. Complete Restoration Ltd will use the information you provide on this form to be in touch with you and to provide updates and marketing via email. You can change your mind at any time by contacting us at &#039;info@completerestoration.co.uk&#039;. We will treat your information with respect. For more information about our privacy practices please visit the privacy policy page.</span></span></span></span> </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpcf7-response-output wpcf7-display-none\"></div></form></div>             </div>\n            </div>\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"divtestimonials\"  style=\"background:#6e6e6d url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/testimonialbackgroundimage.png);no-repeat;cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:21px;\">\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n             <span id=\"quote-content\"><p>The Complete Restoration Company brings period beauty back to life, making sure each project or item fits perfectly for contemporary or traditional living and design.</p>\n</span>\n             </div>\n            </div>\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n        </div>           \n    </div>\n    </section>    \n<section class=\"target-section target sectcompanies \" id=\"sectcompanies\">\n\t<div  class=\"accredited\">\n        <hr class=\"hrseparatortop\" />\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Proud members of...</h2>\n\t\t<br class=\"tabseparatortop\" />\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"companies\" >\n      <li class=\"licompany\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" >\n           <img class=\"imgcomapny\" src=\"https://